{"seq":52,"slug":"game-modding-ugc","title":"Mod 支持与 UGC 工程","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"mod-支持与-ugc-工程\">Mod 支持与 UGC 工程</h1><p>一款游戏发售后真正决定它能活三年还是十年的，往往不是续作，而是玩家自己做的内容。《上古卷轴 5：天际》在 2011 年发售，到 2026 年仍稳居 Steam 同时在线榜前列，靠的正是 Nexus Mods 上数十万个模组；《我的世界》《城市：天际线》《巴泰里恩》同样把「可被玩家改造」写进了产品基因。Mod 支持与 UGC（用户生成内容）工程，就是把这种「让外人安全地往你的游戏里塞代码和资产」的能力，当成一个严肃的系统工程问题来设计。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 回答四个层层递进的问题：<strong>为什么要做、架构上怎么留口子、生态怎么运转、上线后怎么守住底线。</strong> 四条主线对应四个章节，建议按顺序读。</p>\n<p><a href=\"foundations/\">基础</a> 先讲清楚动机与地基：<a href=\"foundations/why-modding\">为何支持 Mod</a> 用真实的留存与营收数据论证 modding 的商业价值；<a href=\"foundations/moddable-architecture\">可扩展架构</a> 讲如何在引擎里预留扩展缝（seam）、钩子与数据驱动设计，让外部内容有处可插；<a href=\"foundations/data-vs-code-mods\">数据型与代码型 Mod</a> 给出从纯配置到完整脚本的「能力谱」，这是贯穿全 hub 的分类坐标。</p>\n<p><a href=\"extension/\">扩展机制</a> 是技术核心，讲三种把控制权交给外人的具体手段：<a href=\"extension/scripting-sandbox\">脚本沙箱</a> 讲 Lua 与 WebAssembly 沙箱的能力模型与隔离原理；<a href=\"extension/mod-api-design\">Mod API 设计</a> 讲对外接口的稳定性契约与事件钩子；<a href=\"extension/asset-pipeline-mods\">Mod 资产管线</a> 讲美术、音频、关卡这类资源如何被覆盖、合并与热加载。</p>\n<p><a href=\"ecosystem/\">生态</a> 把视角从单个 mod 抬到「成百上千个 mod 共存」：<a href=\"ecosystem/mod-distribution\">分发与 Workshop</a> 讲 Steam 创意工坊、mod.io、Nexus 等平台；<a href=\"ecosystem/mod-dependencies\">依赖与加载顺序</a> 讲依赖图与拓扑排序，LOOT 那套学问就在这里；<a href=\"ecosystem/mod-version-compat\">版本兼容</a> 讲游戏更新后如何不把存量 mod 全部打废。</p>\n<p><a href=\"practice/\">实践</a> 收口于风险与商业：<a href=\"practice/mod-security\">Mod 安全与沙箱逃逸</a> 拆解真实 CVE 与威胁模型；<a href=\"practice/ugc-moderation\">UGC 审核</a> 讲海量内容的人机协同治理；<a href=\"practice/ugc-monetization\">UGC 商业化</a> 讲付费 mod 与创作者分成的设计与法律边界。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>要划清楚，避免读者迷路。本 hub 关注「把扩展能力开放给玩家」这件事的端到端工程；脚本语言本身（Lua VM 嵌入、字节码、可视化脚本）的纵深属于 <a href=\"../game-scripting-systems/\">游戏脚本系统</a>，本 hub 只取其「沙箱化」这一面；编辑器与 DCC 工具链的实现属于 <a href=\"../game-tools-editor-development/\">游戏工具与编辑器开发</a>，本 hub 关心的是把工具产物喂给运行时；而 mod 带来的反作弊与客户端信任问题，纵深在 <a href=\"../game-anti-cheat-security/\">反作弊与游戏安全</a>，本 hub 只谈沙箱这一层防线。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：读者应熟悉一门现代语言（C++/C#/Rust 任一）、理解进程与内存隔离的基本概念、对游戏循环与资源加载有感性认识。不要求懂任何特定引擎。<strong>推荐路径</strong>：引擎开发者按 1→2→3→4 顺序通读；平台/运营同学可直接跳到 <a href=\"ecosystem/\">生态</a> 与 <a href=\"practice/\">实践</a>；安全工程师重点看 <a href=\"extension/scripting-sandbox\">脚本沙箱</a> 与 <a href=\"practice/mod-security\">Mod 安全</a> 这一对。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-modding","title":"为何支持 Mod","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/foundations/why-modding"},{"seq":2,"slug":"moddable-architecture","title":"可扩展架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/foundations/moddable-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-vs-code-mods","title":"数据型与代码型 Mod","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/foundations/data-vs-code-mods"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"extension","title":"扩展机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scripting-sandbox","title":"脚本沙箱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension/scripting-sandbox"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mod-api-design","title":"Mod API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension/mod-api-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"asset-pipeline-mods","title":"Mod 资产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension/asset-pipeline-mods"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecosystem","title":"生态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mod-distribution","title":"分发与 Workshop","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-distribution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mod-dependencies","title":"依赖与加载顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-dependencies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mod-version-compat","title":"版本兼容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/ecosystem/mod-version-compat"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mod-security","title":"Mod 安全与沙箱逃逸","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/mod-security"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ugc-moderation","title":"UGC 审核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/ugc-moderation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ugc-monetization","title":"UGC 商业化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/practice/ugc-monetization"}]}]}